%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed70aee8cc8cd4f8ca7ec0b6c7dc5db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChapterTwoRooftop
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Northbound.Runtime::Northbound.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  id: chapter_two_rooftop
  lines:
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: If we keep moving the date, it stops being a plan.
    textChinese: 如果我们一直改日期，这就不再是计划了。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: A plan should survive the people inside it changing.
    textChinese: 一个计划，应该容得下计划里的人发生改变。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Noah
    text: Friday is close. That does not make the answer simple.
    textChinese: 星期五已经很近了，但这不代表答案就变简单了。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: What should matter most now?
    textChinese: 现在，什么才应该被放在第一位？
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices:
    - text: Keep Friday fixed. A plan only means something if we honor it.
      textChinese: 守住星期五。计划只有被兑现，才真正算数。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch2_a
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 10
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: -4
      - id: bond_elias
        amount: 3
      - id: bond_maya
        amount: -1
      nextLineIndex: 4
    - text: Keep preparing, but leave room for the people the plan is meant to serve.
      textChinese: 继续准备，但也给计划里的人留出改变的余地。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch2_b
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 4
      - id: tendency_rootedness
        amount: 4
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 4
      - id: bond_elias
        amount: 1
      - id: bond_maya
        amount: 1
      nextLineIndex: 5
    - text: Stop treating the north as more real than the lives already happening here.
      textChinese: 别再把北方看得比眼前正在发生的生活更真实。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch2_c
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: -8
      - id: tendency_rootedness
        amount: 10
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 7
      - id: bond_elias
        amount: -1
      - id: bond_maya
        amount: 3
      nextLineIndex: 6
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: Good. Friday stays. I can carry the work if I know the promise is still ours.
    textChinese: 好。星期五不变。只要这份约定还是大家的，我就能继续扛下去。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Then keep the map open. Do not turn one date into a locked door.
    textChinese: 那就让地图继续摊开。别让一个日期变成锁死的门。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Thank you. Wanting what is here does not make any of us cowards.
    textChinese: 谢谢。珍惜眼前的生活，并不会让任何人变成懦夫。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: Elias redraws Friday in darker marker, but no one mistakes the ink for agreement.
    textChinese: 伊莱亚斯用更深的笔迹重新圈住星期五，但没有人再把这道墨迹当成全体同意。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: Noah records the silence after Jamie's answer. Leo does not cover it with a joke.
    textChinese: 诺亚录下杰米回答后的沉默。利奥没有再用笑话把它盖过去。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
